# Patch for flash-linear-attention (fla-core) 0.5.2, file fla/ops/cp/chunk_delta_h.py.
# Source: https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention at tag v0.5.2
# (commit 9c8e42e762fce087c27b673af4922795d9edb85e), same file as the fla-core 0.5.2 wheel on PyPI.
# The triton.autotune key of merge_fwd_bwd_kernel names "BT", which is not a kernel argument.
# Triton 3.9 (PyTorch 26.11 base) rejects such keys when fla is imported. Earlier Triton dropped
# the unknown name, so removing it keeps the same tuning key. fla 0.6 no longer has this key;
# remove this patch with that upgrade. Docker accepts only the original or the already-patched
# source.
